## 🌐 CCNA: Episode 6 (3-Tier Network Design)

### The 3-Tier Hierarchical Architecture
When networks grow, flat designs collapse under traffic. Engineers split them into three tiers:

| Layer | Role | Hacker Perspective |
|---|---|---|
| **Access (Tier 1)** | Connects end-user PCs/phones | Compromise here = own the local PCs |
| **Distribution (Tier 2)** | Middle management, policies | Good for lateral movement |
| **Core (Tier 3)** | High-speed backbone to internet | Compromise here = own the whole company |

